abstract: |
  A stylized hybrid mechanism model encoding strategic negotiations and operational dynamics 
  of the Australian National Health Reform Agreement (NHRA). Supports Global Sensitivity 
  Analysis, automated calibration, and interactive policy scenario analysis.
